# OHOS: a pane program that exits without resetting terminal mouse tracking
# leaves the pane forwarding pointer reports into the shell prompt; clear them
# when the agent process exits and the pane hands the terminal back to its shell.
diff --git a/src/pane.rs b/src/pane.rs
